   "locked": false,
   "text": "Notes\n- The block-8 CLS token and the final embedding come from the same forward pass.\n- The checkpoint carries the fire/smoke head. Authenticity is evaluated on backbone features (dashed).\n- The assessor never confirms a wildfire and never rejects a photo automatically.\n- Baselines compared on the same splits: ResNet-50, EfficientNet-B0.",
   "originalText": "Notes\n- The block-8 CLS token and the final embedding come from the same forward pass.\n- The checkpoint carries the fire/smoke head. Authenticity is evaluated on backbone features (dashed).\n- The assessor never confirms a wildfire and never rejects a photo automatically.\n- Baselines compared on the same splits: ResNet-50, EfficientNet-B0.",
